        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Strikes: A School of War, But Not the War Itself &mdash; Poster</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #d9d9d9;\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    width: 1069px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #cfcfcf;\n    padding: 14px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .poster {\n    background: #000;\n    border: 6px solid #f2f2f2;\n    padding: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Header band ---------- */\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    background: #000;\n    padding: 18px 20px 12px 22px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .header .strikes {\n    color: #cc1417;\n    font-family: \"Arial Black\", Impact, Haettenschweiler, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 108px;\n    line-height: 0.85;\n    letter-spacing: -2px;\n    transform: scaleX(1.02);\n    margin: 0 18px 0 0;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .header .subtitle {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 33px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    padding-bottom: 4px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Quote block on white ---------- */\n  .quote-top {\n    background: #f4f4f2;\n    padding: 20px 40px 14px 240px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .quote-top p {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #cc1417;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    line-height: 1.32;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Image zone ---------- */\n  .place