owing a building]\n      </figure>\n\n      <div class=\"quote-bottom\">\n        <p>A strike, moreover, opens the eyes of the workers to the nature, not only of the capitalists, but of the government and the laws as well. <span class=\"attribution\">LENIN</span></p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
